  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After the one time you actually announced you were going to do this, you have on multiple occasions forcefully enabled impostors on my avatars without my input, including recently. I'm told the impostor doesn't generate on my quest avatar, resulting in a completely invisible avatar. Now, my fallback is a bit cheeky, but it *works*, and people actually seem to like it (I get amused praise regularly). When you turn me into an invisible person without warning or consent, people treat me with distrust and animosity. I get blocked by complete strangers until I figure out what's going on and go and delete the impostors YET again. This is extra annoying because I moderate several groups and people blocking me like that gets in the way. Please stop!",
